# Keepsake Club working agreements

- Treat this as an Android-first local-only prototype with roughly 100 hours of investment.
- Prefer the smallest working change and reuse existing adapters and storage.
- Keep photo metadata on-device and never add cloud upload without an explicit decision.
- Use pnpm for JavaScript package operations.

## Docs and Storybook (required)

- Canonical human docs live in `apps/docs` (VitePress). Deploy from that package with the Vercel CLI.
- Product decisions go in `apps/docs/decisions.md` (not the root `docs/` stubs).
- When changing architecture, public components, main dependencies, or the TS→Android build path: update the matching page under `apps/docs`.
- When adding or changing a presentational component under `src/components/`: add/update a `*.stories.tsx` and mention it on `apps/docs/components.md` / `apps/docs/storybook-guide.md`.
- Dual Storybook: on-device (`EXPO_PUBLIC_STORYBOOK_ENABLED`) and web (`.storybook-web`); share the same story files.
